 so also shall be the latter. The first Redeemer made manna descend from heaven, as it is said in Ex 16:4, 'And I will rain bread from heaven for you.' So also the latter Redeemer shall make manna descend, as it is said, Ps 72:16, 'There shall be a handful of corn in the earth.' etc.\"</p>\n<p>my flesh. 52-57; Mt 20:28; Lu 22:19; Eph 5:2,25; Tit 2:14; Heb 10:5-12,20 the life. 33; 1:29; 3:16; 2Co 5:19,21; 1Jo 2:2; 4:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-6-52","title":"John 6:52","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":52,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":52},"content":"<p>strove. 41; 7:40-43; 9:16; 10:19 How. 3:4,9; 4:11; Ac 17:32; 1Co 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-6-53","title":"John 6:53","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":53,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":53},"content":"<p>Verily. 26,47; 3:3; Mt 5:18 Except. 3:3,5; 13:8; 15:4; Mt 18:3; Lu 13:3,5 eat. 55; 3:36; Mt 26:26-28; 1Jo 5:12; Re 2:7,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-6-54","title":"John 6:54","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":54,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":54},"content":"<p>eateth. 27,40,63; 4:14; Ps 22:26; Pr 9:4-6; Isa 25:6-8; 55:1-3; Ga 2:20 Php 3:7-10 hath. 39,40,47</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-6-55","title":"John 6:55","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":55,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":55},"content":"<p>meat. 32; 1:9,47; 8:31,36; 15:1; Ps 4:7; Heb 8:2; 1Jo 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-6-56","title":"John 6:56","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":56,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":56},"content":"<p>He that. La 3:24 dwelleth. 14:20,23; 15:4,5; 17:21-23; Ps 90:1; 91:1,9; 2Co 6:16; Eph 3:17 1Jo 3:24; 4:12,15,16; Re 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-6-57","title":"John 6:57","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":6,"verseStart":57,"chapterEnd":6,"verseEnd":57},"content":"<p>the living